
# Old domain (renamed to The Ambition Department, 2026-10-26). Mercedes's server only, appended to the live Caddyfile
# like Caddyfile.demo; never part of the customer kit. Every scrollyseo.com link keeps its path on the new site, with
# HTTPS (Caddy gets the certificate once the @ and www A records point at this server). hooks/demo are unaffected.
scrollyseo.com, www.scrollyseo.com {
	redir https://theambitiondepartment.com{uri} permanent
}
